<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>XiaoMiao · Dev Dashboard</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, monospace;
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #e5e7eb;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: #38bdf8;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      color: #22d3ee;
    }
    p {
      margin: 0.75rem 0;
    }
    ul {
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
    }
    li {
      margin: 0.4rem 0;
    }
    code {
      background: #1e293b;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.9em;
    }
    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #1e40af;
      color: #e0f2fe;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      margin-right: 6px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }
    footer {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #94a3b8;
      border-top: 1px solid #334155;
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }
    a {
      color: #38bdf8;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
<h1>🛠  Xiaomiao·Dev控制面板</h1>
    <p>
      Personal developer operations dashboard and web terminal for managing
      self-hosted services and executing server/DevOps commands. Integrates AI
      assistance for code generation and command interpretation.
    </p>

    <div>
      <span class="tag">Non-commercial</span>
      <span class="tag">DevOps Tool</span>
      <span class="tag">AI-assisted</span>
      <span class="tag">Web Terminal</span>
  </div>

    <h2>Features</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Self-hosted service monitoring and management</li>
      <li>Browser-based web terminal / command execution</li>
      <li>AI-assisted code generation and command explanation</li>
      <li>Automated deployment script entrypoints</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Deployment Scripts</h2>
    <p>The project includes automation scripts:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><code>setup.sh</code> – environment bootstrap</li>
      <li><code>full-deploy.sh</code> – one-click deployment</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Status</h2>
    <p>
      This is a personal, non-commercial technical project under active
      development. It is intended solely for personal learning and DevOps
      practice, and does not provide proxy, VPN, or commercial services.
    </p>

    <footer>
      © XiaoMiao · Personal Developer Project ·
      <a href="https://github.com/WA438" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    </footer>
  </div>
